post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
WaylandBetterVoice installed.

Next steps (run as your normal desktop user):
  1. Enable service: systemctl --user enable --now waylandbettervoice.service
  2. Link plugin: ln -s /usr/share/waylandbettervoice/noctalia-plugin ~/.config/noctalia/plugins/waylandbettervoice
  3. Copy /usr/share/waylandbettervoice/niri-keybinds.kdl to ~/.config/niri/cfg/waylandbettervoice.kdl,
     then add include "./cfg/waylandbettervoice.kdl" to your niri config.

Existing vocalinux installation, autostart, and CUDA pywhispercpp provider remain untouched.
EOF
}
